{"games":[{"id":14989379535,"name":"[XMAS] Elemental Grounds","desc":"Active Codes: \"fastspin\"\n\nElemental Grounds is a unique style fighting game with heavy scaling, rarity and lore with 30+ abilities. Progression is based on rarity, stats and items, lore, also obtainment of cosmetics.\nSkills scale with 4 stats and level. Everything scales.\n\n100,000+ unique shinies for every element.\n\n♦️ Abilities:\nEarth, Water, Wind, Builder, Fire, Ice, Poison, Snow, Sand, Solar, Nature, Magma, Elementless, Gravity, Lightning, Light, Dark, Equinox, Time, Multielemental, Mechanization Forms\n\n✦ Evolutions:\nPioneer, Bestowed One, Entity Beyond Time, Heavenly, Heavenly Abomination, Abyssal, Abyssal Abomination, Gravitron, Stormweaver, Champion, Shinobi, Shogun, Frostfire, Armament, Murk, Glass","path":"/game/14989379535-elemental-grounds","slug":"14989379535-elemental-grounds","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/04804c1581cf1b87fb1cdcfb7de7191267ab5936e3424ea119df6b93721c03f2.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-0229b8b5b9566eb91efbaff5b719b0ab/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":15,"visitor":5775177,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-12-12T02:06:29.650Z","creator":{"name":"XD Game Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":15287175605,"name":"Outlaw (PRE ALPHA)","desc":"❓ \"Outlaw\" is a Open World experience that revolves mainly around Police VS Criminals!\n🤑 Read the tutorial/help in game to learn more!\n\nGame is in (Pre Alpha) please expect bugs and unfinished features. Game is actively being developed every day!\n⚠️Please report any bugs or suggestions to the server or group, thanks!\n\n💸 Work a job at different places in the city to make money legally.\n💰 Rob different places in the city to make money illegally, receiving a wanted level by the Cops.\n👮 Arrest wanted players and earn XP, you also receive paychecks every 5 minutes!\n🔫 Purchase guns at the \"Guns 4 Less\" or \"High End Gun